      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `d85e934363291172225561893c4dd53e4e7d71fc690098b719f1039d048539f5--victims-of-crime-australia.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Victims (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2016\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 7 of 7\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 7b7f754a65038bae44d1683ed7aa8688afc24c36c8f656b3466736c9b747e20e | missing |\n| \"Table 1\" | 356972a8f31f9c8d471240a66d86ceab5a6377c87785326cab2f393a3c54d26b | missing |\n| \"Table 2\" | cfaa19ceb72dc651f133f4543a99ab163cb52069d52b736ca8afe852cfdfe5d6 | missing |\n| \"Table 3\" | 1f8b8afada59484ed6931766dd7d47641ab976c5f26182a3cfbbc84942258a7c | missing |\n| \"Table 4\" | cb58b49ffb4d515ab636e8e99c0969f6f2ab462336c4da22fc2d74cee56cb711 | missing |\n| \"Table 5\" | f0206bc85b7d2166a81b655da5305cb46b25933a2fce25844e93dd36902b2f8f | missing |\n| \"Explanatory Notes\" | 67f8d90096f89581b12e17c270d58fa79071ad949c6e642a25ad10711786927d | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
